  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to Serenity Now on 30A!<br><br>Beautifully updated with designer finishes in Nov 2025<br>Private 2-tier pool with waterfall<br>Heated for $55/day (48 hrs notice)<br>6-Seater Golf Cart <br>5 brand-new YOLO Beach Cruisers<br>Beach gear included: backpack chairs, umbrellas, and beach towels<br>Easy walk to Blue Mountain Beach access<br>Quiet, safe cul-de-sac near restaurants, trails & Gulf Place<br><br>Prime Location: Nestled in the heart of Blue Mountain Beach, this five-bedroom, four-and-a-half-bathroom vacation rental offers the ultimate retreat. Situated in a quiet cul-de-sac just off 30A, it provides easy access to all the attractions and amenities you desire.<br><br>Private 2-Tier Pool with Waterfall: Dive into relaxation in your own private oasis. Our two-tier pool with a soothing waterfall is perfect for unwinding after a day of adventure. Enjoy lounging poolside or take a refreshing dip to beat the Florida heat.<br><br>Luxury Amenities: Step inside and discover luxury at every turn. From hardwood flooring to granite countertops and stainless-steel appliances, this home exudes elegance and comfort.<br><br>Family-Friendly Living: Gather in the spacious main floor living area, complete with plush seating and a 55\" flat-screen TV. The open floor plan seamlessly connects the living space, kitchen, and dining area, fostering quality time with loved ones.<br><br>Comfortable Sleeping Arrangements: With four bedrooms spread across three floors, everyone will find their own slice of paradise. The king and queen bedrooms on the first floor offer convenience and privacy, while the master suite and loft on the second floor provide additional comfort and stunning views.<br><br>Outdoor Paradise: Step outside to the newly expanded pool deck and let vacation bliss wash over you. Grill up a feast on the gas grill, dine al fresco with the family, or simply lounge by the pool on one of the provided chairs. The pool can even be heated during winter months for year-round enjoyment.<br><br>Ample Parking: Say goodbye to parking woes with our spacious driveway accommodating up to five cars with ease.<br><br>Escape to Serenity Now on 30A and indulge in the ultimate luxury vacation experience. Book your stay now and let serenity overcome you in this exquisite retreat!<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS:<br><br>FIRST FLOOR: <br>Studio: Queen Bed with Private Bathroom with Shower <br>Guest Bedroom: King Bed Shared Tub/Shower Combo<br>Guest Bedroom: Queen Bed & Twin Bed Shared Tub/Shower Combo<br><br>SECOND FLOOR:<br>Primary Bedroom: King Bed & Twin Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower <br><br>THIRD FLOOR: <br>Loft: Twin Bunk Beds, Twin Day Bed & Private Bathroom with Shower",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
